      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1751.png",
      "downloads": 30558,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Simple project that increases the framerate limit in sptarkov.</p>\n<p>IF YOURE USING FIKA USE 144FPS AS YOUR MENU LIMIT.</p>\n<p><strong>After extracting mod to your SPT directory, in game go to your graphics settings and slide your fps limit up.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Does NOT increase performance</strong></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support My Work</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Never feel obligated to donate for support.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mattdokn\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/mattdokn</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
